## Using Individual Phases

Users can run phases individually for more control:

| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `/@NAMESPACE@brainstorm` | Just explore and create brainstorm.md |
| `/@NAMESPACE@sample` | Just walk through UX and create walkthrough.md |
| `/@NAMESPACE@scope` | Just create menu-plan.yaml from brainstorm |
| `/@NAMESPACE@finalize` | Just convert existing menu-plan to beads + specs |
| `/@NAMESPACE@mise` | Run all four phases with review pauses |

@IF_CLAUDECODE@
**Example workflows:**

```
# Full orchestrated flow
/@NAMESPACE@mise

# Skip brainstorm (clear requirements)
/@NAMESPACE@mise skip-brainstorm

# Skip sample (no UX to walk through)
/@NAMESPACE@mise skip-sample

# Individual phases for maximum control
/@NAMESPACE@brainstorm
# ... review and refine ...
/@NAMESPACE@sample
# ... review and refine ...
/@NAMESPACE@scope
# ... review and refine ...
/@NAMESPACE@finalize
```

---

## Error Handling

If any step fails:

1. **Brainstorm fails** - Report what went wrong, offer to skip to sample
2. **Sample fails** - Report what went wrong, offer to skip to scope
3. **Scope fails** - Report error, suggest running brainstorm/sample first
4. **Finalize fails** - Report error, suggest reviewing menu-plan.yaml

```
PLANNING CYCLE: Incomplete
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

