[3/4] SCOPE       ✓
[4/4] FINALIZE    ✗ (error: <reason>)

Failed at: FINALIZE
Error: <description>

──────────────────────────────────────────

Run /@NAMESPACE@finalize to retry after fixing the issue.
```

